# Kör med REST Client i VS Code mot Vercel.
# Stäng av automatisk cookiehantering; varje roll har explicit cookie.
# Ändra runId vid varje körning. Konton kan inte tas bort via API:t.
# Kör uppifrån och ner. Använd framtida datum när du testar.
# Konto-e-post kan ändras mellan körningar för att undvika 409 vid registrering.
# Namngivna requests gör att följande anrop kan använda svarens ID och cookie.
@base = https://stayfinder-tau-sepia.vercel.app/api
@runId = granskning-20261002-01
@checkIn = 2027-01-10
@checkOut = 2027-01-13
@adjacentOut = 2027-01-15

### 201: registrera värd
# @name hostRegister
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"API Värd","email":"api-vard-{{runId}}@example.test","password":"StayFinder2026!"}

### 201: registrera gäst
# @name guestRegister
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"API Gäst","email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","password":"StayFinder2026!"}

### 200: inloggning värd, få sessionscookie
# @name hostLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"api-vard-{{runId}}@example.test","password":"StayFinder2026!"}

### 200: inloggning gäst, separat sessionscookie
# @name guestLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","password":"StayFinder2026!"}

### G2, 200: vem är inloggad?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### G6, 401: en anonym besökare får inte skapa boende
# Stäng REST Clients automatiska cookiehantering eller använd separat anonym session.
POST {{base}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: stayfinder_session=invalid

{"title":"Testboende","description":"Ett bra testboende nära naturen.","location":"Teststad","price_per_night":1000,"max_guests":4}

### G6, 401: en anonym besökare får inte ändra ett boende
PUT {{base}}/properties/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: stayfinder_session=invalid

{"title":"Testboende","description":"Ett bra testboende nära naturen.","location":"Teststad","price_per_night":1000,"max_guests":4}

### G6, 401: en anonym besökare får inte ta bort ett boende
DELETE {{base}}/properties/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Cookie: stayfinder_session=invalid

### G7, 201: skapa ett boende
# @name createProperty
POST {{base}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"title":"Testboende","description":"Ett bra testboende nära naturen.","location":"Teststad","price_per_night":1000,"max_guests":4}

### G4/G5/G8, 200: publik lista, kombinerade filter och fallande pris
GET {{base}}/properties?location=Teststad&max_price=1200&guests=3&sort=price_desc
Cookie: stayfinder_session=invalid

### G8, 200: stigande pris sorteras i backend
GET {{base}}/properties?sort=price_asc

### G8, 200: fallande pris sorteras i backend
GET {{base}}/properties?sort=price_desc

### G4, 200: detaljsida
GET {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}

### G14, 404: saknat boende
GET {{base}}/properties/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### G10, 400: ogiltig e-post och noll gäster
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"fel","guests":0,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{checkOut}}"}

### G10, 400: incheckning efter utcheckning
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":2,"check_in":"{{checkOut}}","check_out":"{{checkIn}}"}

### VG3, 400: för många gäster
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":5,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{checkOut}}"}

### VG5, 400: passerad incheckning
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":2,"check_in":"2020-01-01","check_out":"2020-01-03"}

### G9/VG6, 201: boka; skickat pris 1 ignoreras, totalen blir 3000
# @name createBooking
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":2,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{checkOut}}","total_price":1}

### VG2, 409 BOOKING_CONFLICT: samma period kan inte bokas igen
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-vard-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":1,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{checkOut}}"}

### VG2, 201: angränsande datum får bokas (utcheckningsdagen ingår inte)
# @name adjacentBooking
POST {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-vard-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":1,"check_in":"{{checkOut}}","check_out":"{{adjacentOut}}"}

### VG2, 409 BOOKING_CONFLICT: även en ändrad bokning får inte överlappa
PUT {{base}}/bookings/{{adjacentBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-vard-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":1,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{adjacentOut}}"}

### G12, 204: städa den angränsande testbokningen
DELETE {{base}}/bookings/{{adjacentBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### VG1, 404: gästen får inte ta bort värdens boende
DELETE {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### VG1, 404: gästen får inte ändra värdens boende
PUT {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"title":"Försök att ändra","description":"Det här ska nekas av databasen.","location":"Teststad","price_per_night":1,"max_guests":4}

### VG4, 403: gästen får inte bekräfta bokningen
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"status":"confirmed"}

### G12/VG1, 200: värden ser bokningar för sitt boende
GET {{base}}/bookings?property_id={{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### VG2, 200: uppdatering med samma datum ska inte krocka med sig själv
PUT {{base}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":3,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{checkOut}}"}

### VG6, 200: ändra boendets pris
PUT {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"title":"Testboende","description":"Ett bra testboende nära naturen.","location":"Teststad","price_per_night":2000,"max_guests":4}

### VG6, 200: bokningens total ska fortfarande vara 3000
GET {{base}}/bookings
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### VG7, 200: testboendet ska inte ingå i lediga resultat för bokad period
GET {{base}}/properties?location=Teststad&max_price=2500&guests=2&sort=price_desc&check_in={{checkIn}}&check_out={{checkOut}}
Cookie: stayfinder_session=invalid

### VG7, 400: ogiltig sökperiod
GET {{base}}/properties?check_in={{checkOut}}&check_out={{checkIn}}

### VG4, 200: värden bekräftar
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"status":"confirmed"}

### VG4, 200: gästen avbokar
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"status":"cancelled"}

### VG4, 400: avbokad bokning kan inte ändras
PUT {{base}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"email":"api-gast-{{runId}}@example.test","guests":2,"check_in":"{{checkIn}}","check_out":"{{checkOut}}"}

### G12, 204: ta bort bokningen
DELETE {{base}}/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### G6, 204: värden tar bort sitt boende
DELETE {{base}}/properties/{{createProperty.response.body.$.id}}
Cookie: {{hostLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### G1, 204: logga ut och återkalla sessionen
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### G1, 401: den återkallade cookien fungerar inte
GET {{base}}/bookings
Cookie: {{guestLogin.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

# Fler fall finns i npm test: direkt SQL/RLS, annan gästs osynliga bokning,
# samtidiga bokningsförsök, angränsande datum, ändring som skapar överlappning,
# påbörjad bokning, manipulation av ägare och pris samt kapacitetssänkning.
